        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531980/extras/c5fd58bc05a7b19de724cba7978ad19e.avif?t=1757131206\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins in Alzario, a proud nation with a long and rich history, which finds itself under attack by an evil group of heretical fanatics that call themselves Regalus, who have wreaked havoc across the land targeting the spirit stones of the world. Cialis, a member of the Royal Knights of Alzario, finds herself caught up in one of these attacks while patrolling near Alzario's spirit stone. Backed into a corner and on the verge of defeat, she hears the voice of the spirit Myuei from the stone, and the two form a pact to overcome the Regalus attack. Though they managed to stave off defeat, they soon learn of the series of tragedies befalling the neighboring nations, and of Regalus' mysterious plot to target the spirit stones. It is up to Cialis and the Royal Knights of Alzario to stop Regalus from seeing their plan come to fruition and spreading evil throughout the lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531980/extras/208c5e5662eba758506899d52435b1f5.avif?t=1757131206\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the Obscurite Magie series with this latest entry! Explore Alzario in classic turn-based RPG battles and engage with an enthralling plot to protect the spirit stones and protect the world from the evil of Regalus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531980/extras/3655fa06d927baf700a0f71b00cb3827.avif?t=1757131206\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531980/extras/be58b0a4662f224ab9580022d875832c.avif?t=1757131206\" width=616 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531980/extras/d80c3c8a233cdc361daab4ff235b7da3.avif?t=1757131206\" width=616 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531980/extras/39c035301ce58edbd45ead8b7b58244f.avif?t=1757131206\" width=616 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531980/extras/8fe83b5633fd49747b09e9fbba9dfa19.avif?t=1757131206\" width=616 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531980/extras/ace1b08366ee3414e482b0c0dc881033.avif?t=1757131206\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Extra Events And Plotlines</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock additional scenes and side stories through exploration and meeting particular parameter requirements. There are also more scenes and stories that can only be unlocked after clearing the game, rewarding additional playthroughs!    </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531980/extras/c5fd58bc05a7b19de724cba7978ad19e.avif?t=1757131206\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins in Alzario, a proud nation with a long and rich history, which finds itself under attack by an evil group of heretical fanatics that call themselves Regalus, who have wreaked havoc across the land targeting the spirit stones of the world. Cialis, a member of the Royal Knights of Alzario, finds herself caught up in one of these attacks while patrolling near Alzario's spirit stone. Backed into a corner and on the verge of defeat, she hears the voice of the spirit Myuei from the stone, and the two form a pact to overcome the Regalus attack. Though they managed to stave off defeat, they soon learn of the series of tragedies befalling the neighboring nations, and of Regalus' mysterious plot to target the spirit stones. It is up to Cialis and the Royal Knights of Alzario to stop Regalus from seeing their plan come to fruition and spreading evil throughout the lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531980/extras/208c5e5662eba758506899d52435b1f5.avif?t=1757131206\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the Obscurite Magie series with this latest entry! Explore Alzario in classic turn-based RPG battles and engage with an enthralling plot to protect the spirit stones and protect the world from the evil of Regalus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531980/extras/3655fa06d927baf700a0f71b00cb3827.avif?t=1757131206\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=